137:  <li><strong><code>ingestMemberUpdate</code></strong> (settings above). <code>member</code>/<code>staff</code>: one transaction — read the target doc(s), apply the readTime gate, derive status from the stored source shape, write <code>members</code> and <code>memberProfiles</code> together (or <code>staffRoster</code>), or replace them with tombstones.</li>
