<h2>Decisions log</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Oct 8:</strong> v1 drafted from the foundation plan's Phase E outline after research (F1–F11).</li>
  <li><strong>Oct 8:</strong> review round 1 (Codex "not ready", 9 blocking; Claude "ready after fixes", 3 blocking, 13 should-fix) → v2: the contract, the receiver-side reconcile, E-pre, the stop runbook, the settings table, E-5's audit, the K13 proof; Q6–Q8 added. Review files <code>thoughts/reviews/my-clay-hub-phase-e-plan-round1-*</code>.</li>
