   145	When a snapshot with readTime (100 s, 400 ns) arrives
   146	Then nothing is written and the answer is "stale"
   147	
   148	Given a reconcile batch that would remove 6 of 66 members
   149	When it is posted
   150	Then nothing is written, the answer is 409, and the stop alert fires
   151	
   152	Given a source pause whose endDate is the number 20270201 (malformed)
   153	When its snapshot is ingested
   154	Then the member's status is 'review', and the stored pause holds "!malformed", not the number</div>
