   151	# ─── jq programs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   152	# The checks on the discovered manifest (F2, F6's declaration half, F13, F14). Input: the discovery output. One reason
   153	# per line; none means the manifest may deploy.
