   161	   # A declaration from before D-4 (exactly serviceAccount, invoker, ingress — no trigger) is an HTTP one, ONLY when
   162	   # rebuilding an existing attempt ($legacy: --reconcile, --reverify), so the live pre-D-4 canary attempt can still be
   163	   # re-read (Claude impl review 1). A new deploy (--approved) must declare its trigger (Codex impl review 2).
