   235	<h2>Firebase safety checklist</h2>
   236	<ul>
   237	  <li>Every new collection gets an explicit rule and rules tests in the same commit as the code that writes it, deployed before the function (E-2, E-6).</li>
   238	  <li>Writers to my-clay-hub's member data: <code>ingestMemberUpdate</code> (single and reconcile) and <code>recomputeStatuses</code> (status fields only) — both as <code>ingest@</code>, transactions, never deletes.</li>
   239	  <li>Nothing writes to <code>tinker-hq-apps</code>: <code>clayhub-link@</code> holds only get/list; the codebase uses no write API (tested).</li>
   240	  <li>No forbidden field at any nesting level, and no full phone, crosses projects (contract + fixtures); no personal data in logs.</li>
   241	  <li>Emulator tests only; neither guard can reach the other project; the CLI credential file is never read.</li>
   242	  <li>Bulk changes bounded (Q8) and atomic: a stopped reconcile or recompute writes nothing.</li>
   243	</ul>
   244	
